[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.0,
    "text": "字幕提供"
  },
  {
    "start": 2.0,
    "end": 4.0,
    "text": "字幕提供"
  },
  {
    "start": 4.0,
    "end": 6.0,
    "text": "字幕提供"
  },
  {
    "start": 6.0,
    "end": 9.0,
    "text": "大家好 歡迎來到This is my architecture"
  },
  {
    "start": 9.0,
    "end": 12.0,
    "text": "我是Dixon AWS的Solutions Architect"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.0,
    "end": 14.0,
    "text": "今天我們請到香港01的Dick"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.0,
    "end": 18.0,
    "text": "來跟我們講一下他們的Data Analytics Architecture"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.0,
    "end": 20.0,
    "text": "Dick 可否跟我們講一下香港01"
  },
  {
    "start": 20.0,
    "end": 22.0,
    "text": "香港01除了一個線上媒體之外"
  },
  {
    "start": 22.0,
    "end": 24.0,
    "text": "亦都會帶來發展各方面的業務"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.0,
    "end": 28.0,
    "text": "包括時線中籌 線上等餐服務"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.0,
    "end": 31.0,
    "text": "你們做很多線上的平台"
  },
  {
    "start": 31.0,
    "end": 33.0,
    "text": "應該有很多Data Analytics的需要"
  },
  {
    "start": 33.0,
    "end": 36.0,
    "text": "在Architecture上有甚麼考慮"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.0,
    "end": 39.0,
    "text": "其實香港01很重視數據分析"
  },
  {
    "start": 39.0,
    "end": 42.0,
    "text": "我們在數據平台上主要有兩個考量"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.0,
    "end": 45.0,
    "text": "第一個是能夠處理大量的數據"
  },
  {
    "start": 45.0,
    "end": 49.0,
    "text": "第二是我們希望我們的數據團隊"
  },
  {
    "start": 49.0,
    "end": 51.0,
    "text": "能夠專注在數據分析"
  },
  {
    "start": 51.0,
    "end": 54.0,
    "text": "所以我們採用了Servitless架構"
  },
  {
    "start": 54.0,
    "end": 59.0,
    "text": "去減低團隊對平台維護的時間"
  },
  {
    "start": 59.0,
    "end": 62.0,
    "text": "可以說一下日常的用途"
  },
  {
    "start": 62.0,
    "end": 65.0,
    "text": "你們如何在Architecture上用到嗎"
  },
  {
    "start": 65.0,
    "end": 69.0,
    "text": "可以 以採集Quick Stream為例"
  },
  {
    "start": 69.0,
    "end": 72.0,
    "text": "當我們的用戶瀏覽網站的時候"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.0,
    "end": 75.0,
    "text": "瀏覽紀錄會發一個request去ALB"
  },
  {
    "start": 75.0,
    "end": 81.0,
    "text": "然後ALB會把request通過Lambda去做execute"
  },
  {
    "start": 81.0,
    "end": 87.0,
    "text": "那麼Lambda會再把request發發到"
  },
  {
    "start": 87.0,
    "end": 89.0,
    "text": "Kinesis Firehost"
  },
  {
    "start": 89.0,
    "end": 94.0,
    "text": "最後會儲存到S3 Data Lake裡面"
  },
  {
    "start": 94.0,
    "end": 99.0,
    "text": "我們看到Kinesis搭S3也是一個很常見的組合"
  },
  {
    "start": 99.0,
    "end": 103.0,
    "text": "但ALB搭Lambda也是一個比較新的支援功能"
  },
  {
    "start": 103.0,
    "end": 105.0,
    "text": "為何你們考慮用ALB"
  },
  {
    "start": 105.0,
    "end": 109.0,
    "text": "而沒有用傳統API Gateway和Lambda對接呢"
  },
  {
    "start": 109.0,
    "end": 114.0,
    "text": "無可可應API Gateway是一個比較多功能的平台"
  },
  {
    "start": 114.0,
    "end": 117.0,
    "text": "但我們的用途比較單一"
  },
  {
    "start": 117.0,
    "end": 120.0,
    "text": "所以最後因為成本的考量上我們採用了ALB"
  },
  {
    "start": 120.0,
    "end": 124.0,
    "text": "一個很精明的選擇可以做到cost saving"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.0,
    "end": 128.0,
    "text": "另外在Glue的部分你們又會怎樣用Glue呢"
  },
  {
    "start": 128.0,
    "end": 132.0,
    "text": "其實Glue主要是用來做Data Catalog"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.0,
    "end": 135.0,
    "text": "儲存一些S3上的table的schema"
  },
  {
    "start": 135.0,
    "end": 139.0,
    "text": "所以就有一些RAW的Data就會載到S3"
  },
  {
    "start": 139.0,
    "end": 143.0,
    "text": "然後Glue就會知道有甚麼table在發生"
  },
  {
    "start": 143.0,
    "end": 146.0,
    "text": "我相信你們也要做Data Transformer"
  },
  {
    "start": 146.0,
    "end": 147.0,
    "text": "Data Cleansing"
  },
  {
    "start": 147.0,
    "end": 150.0,
    "text": "那這部分你們是用甚麼方法去做的呢"
  },
  {
    "start": 150.0,
    "end": 154.0,
    "text": "我們不是用傳統的Hadu或Spark的platform"
  },
  {
    "start": 154.0,
    "end": 161.0,
    "text": "我們透過Affina的CATS功能"
  },
  {
    "start": 161.0,
    "end": 166.0,
    "text": "以至到加上我們AFO的Scheduler功能"
  },
  {
    "start": 166.0,
    "end": 169.0,
    "text": "做Data Cleansing Data Transform"
  },
  {
    "start": 169.0,
    "end": 173.0,
    "text": "最後把Transform的Data存回到S3"
  },
  {
    "start": 173.0,
    "end": 175.0,
    "text": "一個很聰明的做法"
  },
  {
    "start": 175.0,
    "end": 178.0,
    "text": "即是用Affina去行你們的Transform"
  },
  {
    "start": 178.0,
    "end": 180.0,
    "text": "然後就更新到S3"
  },
  {
    "start": 180.0,
    "end": 182.0,
    "text": "當作一個ETF"
  },
  {
    "start": 182.0,
    "end": 187.0,
    "text": "我看到你們也有Affina和Redshift的部分"
  },
  {
    "start": 187.0,
    "end": 192.0,
    "text": "你們有甚麼情況去選擇用哪個服務呢"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.0,
    "end": 195.0,
    "text": "其實我們所有做完Transformer Data"
  },
  {
    "start": 195.0,
    "end": 197.0,
    "text": "和Aggregate好的Data都會載到S3"
  },
  {
    "start": 197.0,
    "end": 201.0,
    "text": "但因為我們要配合BIE Tool"
  },
  {
    "start": 201.0,
    "end": 203.0,
    "text": "或一些Dashboard的考量"
  },
  {
    "start": 203.0,
    "end": 206.0,
    "text": "我們會將Data傳送到Redshift"
  },
  {
    "start": 206.0,
    "end": 209.0,
    "text": "讓我們的Retshift"
  },
  {
    "start": 209.0,
    "end": 211.0,
    "text": "能夠很快地去生成"
  },
  {
    "start": 211.0,
    "end": 213.0,
    "text": "亦都我們的Business Analyst"
  },
  {
    "start": 213.0,
    "end": 215.0,
    "text": "有需要的時候"
  },
  {
    "start": 215.0,
    "end": 217.0,
    "text": "亦可以透過Redshift Spectrum"
  },
  {
    "start": 217.0,
    "end": 219.0,
    "text": "去接觸到Wall Data"
  },
  {
    "start": 219.0,
    "end": 222.0,
    "text": "去做一個更加蠻蠻的Data Report"
  },
  {
    "start": 222.0,
    "end": 223.0,
    "text": "所以Data Analyst"
  },
  {
    "start": 223.0,
    "end": 225.0,
    "text": "可能會用Affina"
  },
  {
    "start": 225.0,
    "end": 227.0,
    "text": "然後可能Business User"
  },
  {
    "start": 227.0,
    "end": 229.0,
    "text": "可能會主要透過BI Tool"
  },
  {
    "start": 229.0,
    "end": 230.0,
    "text": "去接觸Redshift"
  },
  {
    "start": 230.0,
    "end": 232.0,
    "text": "如果做Machine Learning的部分"
  },
  {
    "start": 232.0,
    "end": 235.0,
    "text": "可能回到S3 Data Lake"
  },
  {
    "start": 235.0,
    "end": 236.0,
    "text": "拿東西"
  },
  {
    "start": 237.0,
    "end": 240.0,
    "text": "我也看到一個很特別的部分"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.0,
    "end": 242.0,
    "text": "BI Tool 搭了Lambda"
  },
  {
    "start": 242.0,
    "end": 244.0,
    "text": "這裏又發生甚麼事"
  },
  {
    "start": 244.0,
    "end": 247.0,
    "text": "其實BI Tool 通常都有各種各類的限制"
  },
  {
    "start": 247.0,
    "end": 251.0,
    "text": "例如我們不能夠很隨心所欲地"
  },
  {
    "start": 251.0,
    "end": 253.0,
    "text": "設定時間做一個Refresh"
  },
  {
    "start": 253.0,
    "end": 256.0,
    "text": "所以我們透過Schedule一個Lambda功能"
  },
  {
    "start": 256.0,
    "end": 259.0,
    "text": "去用Headless Bowser功能"
  },
  {
    "start": 259.0,
    "end": 266.0,
    "text": "去模擬人手做一些Data Report的Refresh"
  },
  {
    "start": 266.0,
    "end": 270.0,
    "text": "避免要人手做這些工作"
  },
  {
    "start": 270.0,
    "end": 273.0,
    "text": "即是用Lambda假裝一個人做F5 Refresh"
  },
  {
    "start": 273.0,
    "end": 275.0,
    "text": "OK"
  },
  {
    "start": 275.0,
    "end": 278.0,
    "text": "我看到已經有一個很完整的Data Ingest"
  },
  {
    "start": 278.0,
    "end": 280.0,
    "text": "for Click Stream"
  },
  {
    "start": 280.0,
    "end": 282.0,
    "text": "接下來你們還有甚麼發展"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.0,
    "end": 286.0,
    "text": "其實我們很重視實時號的需求"
  },
  {
    "start": 286.0,
    "end": 288.0,
    "text": "所以我們計劃在Kinesis Firehouse"
  },
  {
    "start": 288.0,
    "end": 291.0,
    "text": "將Data除了寫到S3"
  },
  {
    "start": 291.0,
    "end": 294.0,
    "text": "外亦會追蹤一份E-Asset Search"
  },
  {
    "start": 294.0,
    "end": 297.0,
    "text": "讓我們的Business User可以透過Kabana"
  },
  {
    "start": 297.0,
    "end": 301.0,
    "text": "去看一些實時的數據"
  },
  {
    "start": 301.0,
    "end": 304.0,
    "text": "可以輔助他們做一些決策"
  },
  {
    "start": 304.0,
    "end": 306.0,
    "text": "OK 透過Kinesis"
  },
  {
    "start": 306.0,
    "end": 309.0,
    "text": "有另一個低一點Latency的Dashboard"
  },
  {
    "start": 309.0,
    "end": 311.0,
    "text": "這可能是一個高一點Latency"
  },
  {
    "start": 311.0,
    "end": 313.0,
    "text": "做一些比較複雜的數據分析"
  },
  {
    "start": 315.0,
    "end": 318.0,
    "text": "很精彩的Data Analytics Architecture"
  },
  {
    "start": 318.0,
    "end": 320.0,
    "text": "即使用了很多Servorless功能"
  },
  {
    "start": 320.0,
    "end": 322.0,
    "text": "多謝阿Dig"
  },
  {
    "start": 322.0,
    "end": 326.0,
    "text": "多謝大家收視這次的This is my architecture"
  },
  {
    "start": 326.0,
    "end": 328.0,
    "text": "下次跟大家再見"
  },
  {
    "start": 328.0,
    "end": 329.0,
    "text": "再見"
  }
]